{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Postnikov 塔"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Postnikov 塔”"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>对任意连通空间 $X$, 存在一列"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维化","text":"纤维化"}},{"Plain":" $\\cdots\\to P_2\\to P_1$, 以及相容的映射 $X\\to P_i$,\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n\t{ccccc}\r\n\t&amp;&amp;\\vdots\\\\\r\n\t&amp;&amp;\\downarrow\\\\\r\n\t&amp;&amp;P_3&amp;\\leftarrow &amp; K(\\pi_3(X),3)\\\\\r\n\t&amp;\\nearrow&amp;\\downarrow\\\\\r\n\t&amp;&amp;P_2&amp;\\leftarrow &amp; K(\\pi_2(X),2)\\\\\r\n\t&amp;\\nearrow&amp;\\downarrow\\\\\r\n\tX &amp; \\to &amp; P_1\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n满足</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$P_n$ 的超过 $n$ 阶同伦群平凡;</li>\n<li>映射 $X\\to P_n$ 在不超过 $n$ 阶同伦群上为同构;</li>\n<li>对于 $n\\geq 2$, 映射 $P_n\\to P_{n-1}$ 的纤维为 [Eilenberg–MacLane 空间](Eilenberg–MacLane 空间.md) $K(\\pi_n(X),n)$.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>nLab: The Postnikov tower is a factorization of the terminal morphism $X\\to *$ into a tower, where homotopy groups are added from right to left.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>[Whitehead 塔](Whitehead 塔.md)</p>\n"}]}}